From 959c3bcac3622fb9b06a5163ea38ac3b9b76951c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: belikh <io@jupiter.au>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:00:40 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] bootstrap: add the mips64 (SGI Indy) entry and point at local
 runtime crates

bootstrap/src/mips64.rs maps the initial stack with SYS_FMAP ($v0 number,
$a0..$a2 arguments) and calls start; mips64.ld is the riscv64 layout for
elf32-ntradbigmips. USERMODE_END is 0x8000_0000.

Cargo.toml takes redox-rt from ../../../relibc/source/redox-rt and patches
redox_syscall and libc with the fork's vendored copies that carry the
mips64 architecture files.

Signed-off-by: belikh <io@jupiter.au>
